sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main.py
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Clk as FixedClock
    participant Aud as AuditTrail
    participant Srch as paginate()

    Main->>Repo: construct()
    Main->>Clk: construct(base=100.0, step=10.0)
    Main->>Aud: construct()
    Main->>Svc: construct(Repo, Aud, Clk)

    Main->>Svc: create("Alpha")
    Svc->>Clk: now()
    Clk-->>Svc: 100.0
    Svc->>Repo: create(name="Alpha", ts=100.0)
    Repo-->>Svc: Item(id=1,..., created_at=100.0)
    Svc->>Aud: log(op="create", item_id=1, item_name="Alpha", ts=100.0)

    Main->>Svc: update(1, "Alpha2")
    Svc->>Clk: now()
    Clk-->>Svc: 110.0
    Svc->>Repo: update(1, name="Alpha2", ts=110.0)
    Repo-->>Svc: Item(id=1, name="Alpha2", updated_at=110.0)
    Svc->>Aud: log(op="update", item_id=1, item_name="Alpha2", ts=110.0)

    Main->>Svc: search(limit=2, offset=0)
    Svc->>Repo: list_items()
    Repo-->>Svc: list[Item]
    Svc->>Srch: paginate(items, limit=2, offset=0)
    Srch-->>Svc: Page

    Main->>Svc: delete(1)
    Svc->>Clk: now()
    Clk-->>Svc: 120.0
    Svc->>Repo: delete(1)
    Repo-->>Svc: ok
    Svc->>Aud: log(op="delete", item_id=1, item_name="Alpha2", ts=120.0)

    Note right of Svc: Each mutation calls clock.now() exactly once and reuses ts for entity and audit